+## Files Modified
+
+### 1. `/c/Users/deivids/projeto-sistemadecontrole/src/App.tsx`
+
+#### Changes to `handleSaveEmpresa` function (line 1569)
+**Before:**
+```typescript
+const handleSaveEmpresa = (item: Empresa, isNew: boolean) => {
+  // ... validation logic ...
+  saveAndLog(
+    'Empresas', 
+    isNew ? 'Criou' : 'Editou', 
